AoA    Corresponding Source.  Regardless of what server hosts the+AAoA    Corresponding Source, you remain obligated to ensure that it is+AAoA    available for as long as needed to satisfy these requirements.+AAoACgAA    e) Convey the object code using peer-to-peer transmission, provided+AAoA    you inform other peers where the object code and Corresponding+AAoA    Source of the work are being offered to the general public at no+AAoA    charge under subsection 6d.+AAoACgAA  A separable portion of the object code, whose source code is excluded+AAoA-from the Corresponding Source as a System Library, need not be+AAoA-included in conveying the object code work.+AAoACgAA  A +ACIA-User Product+ACIA is either (1) a +ACIA-consumer product+ACIA, which means any+AAoA-tangible personal property which is normally used for personal, family,+AAoA-or household purposes, or (2) anything designed or sold for incorporation+AAoA-into a dwelling.  In determining whether a product is a consumer product,+AAoA-doubtful cases shall be resolved in favor of coverage.  For a particular+AAoA-product received by a particular user, +ACIA-normally used+ACIA refers to a+AAoA-typical or common use of that class of product, regardless of the status+AAoA-of the particular user or of the way in which the particular user+AAoA-actually uses, or expects or is expected to use, the product.  A product+AAoA-is a consumer product regardless of whether the product has substantial+AAoA-commercial, industrial or non-consumer uses, unless such uses represent+AAoA-the only significant mode of use of the product.+AAoACgAA  +ACIA-Installation Information+ACIA for a User Product means any methods,+AAoA-procedures, authorization keys, or other information required to install+AAoA-and execute modified versions of a covered work in that User Product from+AAoA-a modified version of its Corresponding Source.  The information must+AAoA-suffice to ensure that the continued functioning of the modified object+AAoA-code is in no case prevented or interfered with solely because+AAoA-modification has been made.+AAoACgAA  If you convey an object code work under this section in, or with, or+AAoA-specifically for use in, a User Product, and the conveying occurs as+AAoA-part of a transaction in which the right of possession and use of the+AAoA-User Product is transferred to the recipient in perpetuity or for a+AAoA-fixed term (regardless of how the transaction is characterized), the+AAoA-Corresponding Source conveyed under this section must be accompanied+AAoA-by the Installation Information.  But this requirement does not apply+AAoA-if neither you nor any third party retains the ability to install+AAoA-modified object code on the User Product (for example, the work has+AAoA-been installed in ROM).+AAoACgAA  The requirement to provide Installation Information does not include a+AAoA-requirement to continue to provide support service, warranty, or updates+AAoA-for a work that has been modified or installed by the recipient, or for+AAoA-the User Product in which it has been modified or installed.  Access to a+AAoA-network may be denied when the modification itself materially and+AAoA-adversely affects the operation of the network or violates the rules and+AAoA-protocols for communication across the network.+AAoACgAA  Corresponding Source conveyed, and Installation Information provided,+AAoA-in accord with this section must be in a format that is publicly+AAoA-documented (and with an implementation available to the public in+AAoA-source code form), and must require no special password or key for+AAoA-unpacking, reading or copying.+AAoACgAA  7. Additional Terms.+AAoACgAA  +ACIA-Additional permissions+ACIA are terms that supplement the terms of this+AAoA-License by making exceptions from one or more of its conditions.+AAoA-Additional permissions that are applicable to the entire Program shall+AAoA-be treated as though they were included in this License, to the extent+AAoA-that they are valid under